 class="tp">1870–1970</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/juho-kusti-paasikivi"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/juho-kusti-paasikivi.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Juho Kusti Paasikivi</span><span class="tp">1870–1956</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/maria-montessori"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/maria-montessori.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Maria Montessori</span><span class="tp">1870–1952</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/adolf-schulten"><span class="ph ph-person" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><span class="nm">Adolf Schulten</span><span class="tp">1870–1960</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/lavr-kornilov"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/lavr-kornilov.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Lavr Kornilov</span><span class="tp">1870–1918</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/gustav-landauer"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/gustav-landauer.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Gustav Landauer</span><span class="tp">1870–1919</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/herbert-samuel"><span class="ph ph-person" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><span class="nm">Herbert Samuel</span><span class="tp">1870–1963</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/luka-bych"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/luka-bych.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Luka Bych</span><span class="tp">1870–1945</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/sulayman-al-baruni"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/sulayman-al-baruni.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Sulayman al-Baruni</span><span class="tp">1870–1940</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/ivan-bunin"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/ivan-bunin.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="4