h="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Majid bin Said</span><span class="tp">1834–1870</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/gustav-struve"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/gustav-struve.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Gustav Struve</span><span class="tp">1805–1870</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/juan-prim"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/juan-prim.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Juan Prim</span><span class="tp">1814–1870</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/ludwig-of-oettingen-wallerstein"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/ludwig-of-oettingen-wallerstein.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Ludwig of Oettingen-Wallerstein</span><span class="tp">1791–1870</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/thomas-scott-orangeman"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/thomas-scott-orangeman.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Thomas Scott (Orangeman)</span><span class="tp">c. 1842–1870</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/john-papa-i-i"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/john-papa-i-i.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">John Papa ʻĪʻī</span><span class="tp">1800–1870</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/juan-crisostomo-falcon"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/juan-crisostomo-falcon.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Juan Crisóstomo Falcón</span><span class="tp">1820–1870</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/ilunga-kabale"><span class="ph ph-person" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><span class="nm">Ilunga Kabale</span><span class="tp">c. 1840–1870</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
